    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Drone",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Lich drone assault 'Mech was designed by the Word of Blake but was only fielded in limited numbers during the defense against Operation SCOUR. An altered version was later used by the RAF after the Republic of the Sphere enacted their Fortress Protocols. The endo-composite skeleton is protected by seventeen tons of standard armor, allowing the Lich to remain in a fight after taking a massive amount of damage.",
